                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Text of Agreement by the Conference of Diplomatic
                        Representatives</hi>
                </head>
                <p>In view of the answers to the telegraphic appeal sent to the political and
                    military chiefs of the factions struggling in Mexico, on the 11th of August
                    last, the representatives who signed that appeal believe that the time has
                    arrived to carry out the conclusion agreed upon in their last meeting in order
                    to recommend to their respective Governments the recognition as soon as it will
                    be possible of a Government in Mexico that shall have sprung from the
                    independent and exclusive action of the Mexicans and that possess the material
                    and moral capacity to protect the lives and property of nationals and
                    foreigners.</p>
            </div>
